# Stalls' levels (D391) and customers (D392), driven by a test (world_kest's
# stalls_test): two owners, there from the start, whose hands the test
# moves. The first builds on the lot's corner plot and raises its stall; the
# second, pressing on the first's stall, raises nothing. Customers come
# through the gate to the one stall and pay its owner. An owner reaching the
# goal wins the round (D394).
program tycoon.kest
physics3d gravity 0 -10 0
navigation radius 0.35 height 1.8 step 0.3 slope 30 cell 0.2
collision class stall b0eb8fc52cd9d4ac
collision class customer 1a6375d11861b18d
component 0097c04f-e081-44c5-b93d-ba7a6836d3e8 tycoon.hand Hand
component 4143f760-31c1-469d-bda7-7946878bcaba tycoon.owner Owner
component 20f1dacf-e8f6-4c1f-be56-5fc36f9ade8e tycoon.stall Stall
component bd13f2d3-dc87-46f2-b480-ff2eaf5fcdf1 tycoon.customer Customer
component 160c062b-09b3-46a0-8435-9575f99339c1 tycoon.till Till
component 11a256e6-f691-4f0f-8feb-aef4694891f0 tycoon.gate Gate
component 7c496087-7144-4230-85e9-fd119433276c tycoon.round Round
entity tycoon.stall owner
system tycoon.join simulation join write tycoon.owner
system tycoon.tend simulation tend read tycoon.hand write tycoon.owner write rawframe.physics3d.pose entities lookup tycoon.stall after tycoon.join after rawframe.physics3d.step
system tycoon.open simulation open write tycoon.gate random arrivals lookup tycoon.stall after rawframe.physics3d.step
system tycoon.walk simulation walk write tycoon.customer read rawframe.physics3d.pose write rawframe.physics3d.velocity entities before rawframe.navigation.avoid
system tycoon.serve simulation serve read tycoon.stall write tycoon.till read rawframe.physics3d.pose after tycoon.tend
system tycoon.earn simulation earn write tycoon.owner entities lookup tycoon.stall lookup tycoon.till after tycoon.tend after tycoon.serve
system tycoon.judge simulation judge write tycoon.round lookup tycoon.owner lookup tycoon.stall lookup tycoon.customer after tycoon.earn
message won Won
# The program reads its players' collect command (D425).
command collect controls.Collect
spawn 1 rawframe.physics3d.body motion=0 shape=1 width=24 height=0.5 depth=24 rawframe.physics3d.pose y=-0.5 rawframe.physics3d.velocity
spawn 1 tycoon.hand pointed=1 pointX=-22 pointZ=-22 build=1 tycoon.owner rawframe.physics3d.pose
spawn 1 tycoon.hand pointed=1 pointX=22 pointZ=22 tycoon.owner rawframe.physics3d.pose
spawn 1 tycoon.gate
spawn 1 tycoon.round
